  "id": "f59ce0cf-9d71-4bdd-b6d0-577235b63678",
  "title": "OLiVES: Outdoor Low-Light Video Benchmark for Enhancement and Segmentation",
  "summary": "OLiVES introduces a benchmark dataset for outdoor low-light videos with dynamic scenes, designed to support both low-light video enhancement (LLVE) and video object segmentation (VOS). The dataset addresses key content gaps by incorporating a diverse range of natural textures, animals, occlusions, dynamic activities, and close-up scenes. We benchmark state-of-the-art LLVE and VOS methods on OLiVES and show that training on it improves performance on both tasks.",
